---
source: tests/help.rs
expression: help(&path)
---
List sandboxes

Usage: sbt ls [OPTIONS]

Options:
  -D, --debug
          Print each smolvm command line

      --format <FORMAT>
          Output format

          [possible values: table, json, yaml]

      --json
          Same as --format json

  -q, --quiet
          Only print names

  -h, --help
          Print help
